</tr>
<tr style="height: 24px;">
<td style="height: 24px;">Mon, Jan 25</td>
<td style="height: 24px;">Last day to file petitions for course credit by examination (Undergraduate students only)</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 48px;">
<td style="height: 48px;">Mon, Feb 1</td>
<td style="height: 48px;">Tenth day of classes. Courses dropped after this date will have a "W" for withdrawal recorded on the academic record. Last day to add or drop courses without additional signatures (see <a title="Adding or Dropping Courses | Academic Regulations" href="https://catalog.uconn.edu/undergraduate/academic-regulations#registration">Adding and Dropping Courses</a>).</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 24px;">
<td style="height: 24px;">Mon, Feb 8</td>
