</tr>
<tr style="height: 72px;">
<td style="height: 72px;">Tue, Feb 9-Mon, Feb 15</td>
<td style="height: 72px;">Examinations for course credit by examination (Undergraduate students only)</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 48px;">
<td style="height: 48px;">Fri, Feb 12</td>
