</tr>
<tr style="height: 24px;">
<td style="height: 24px;">Tue, Feb 16</td>
<td style="height: 24px;">Dean’s signature required to add courses</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 24px;">
<td style="height: 24px;">Mon, Feb 22-Fri, Mar 12</td>
<td style="height: 24px;">Mid-semester Grading Period</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 48px;">
<td style="height: 48px;">Sun, Mar 14-Sun, Mar 21</td>
<td style="height: 48px;">Spring Recess</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 48px;">
<td style="height: 48px;">Mon, Mar 22</td>
<td style="height: 48px;">Registration for the Summer 2027 and Fall 2027 semester via Student Administration System begins</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 24px;">
<td style="height: 24px;">Sat, Mar 27</td>
<td style="height: 24px;">Emergency closing class makeup date</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 24px;">
<td style="height: 24px;">Thu, Apr 1</td>
<td style="height: 24px;">Deadline to apply for Summer 2027 graduation to be included in the 2027 Commencement Book</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 24px;">
<td rowspan="2" style="height: 48px;">Mon, Apr 12</td>
<td style="height: 24px;">Last day to withdraw from a course</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 24px;">
<td style="height: 24px;">Last day to place courses on or remove from Pass/Fail grading</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 72px;">
<td style="height: 72px;">Fri, Apr 23</td>
<td style="height: 72px;">Last day for Master’s and Doctoral degree candidates to upload final Master's thesis or Doctoral dissertation to the university-supported repository and submit related paperwork to Degree Audit (<a href="mailto:degreeaudit@uconn.edu">degreeaudit@uconn.edu</a>) for conferral of a Spring 2027 degree.</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 24px;">
<td style="height: 24px;">Fri, Apr 30</td>
<td style="height: 24px;">Last day of spring semester classes</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 48px;">
<td style="height: 48px;">Sat, May 1-Sun, May 2</td>
<td style="height: 48px;">Reading Days</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 48px;">
<td style="height: 48px;">Mon, May 3-Sat, May 8</td>
<td style="height: 48px;">Final examinations</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 72px;">
<td style="height: 72px;">Sat, May 8-Sun, May 9</td>
<td style="height: 72px;">Commencement ceremonies. For more information, please visit <a href="http://commencement.uconn.edu" target="_blank" rel="noopener">commencement.uconn.edu</a></td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 24px;">
<td style="height: 24px;">Sun, May 9</td>
<td style="height: 24px;">Conferral date for Spring 2027 degrees. Final examinations for Plan B Master’s and Sixth-Year Certificate students must be completed by this date.</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 24px;">
<td style="height: 24px;">Tue, May 11</td>
<td style="height: 24px;">Semester grades due at 4pm</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 24px;">
<td style="height: 24px;">Fri, May 21</td>
<td style="height: 24px;">Last day for Degree Audit (<a href="mailto:degreeaudit@uconn.edu">degreeaudit@uconn.edu</a>) to receive the approved Plan B Master’s and Sixth-Year Certificate Report on the Final Exam. (Graduate students only)</td>
</tr>
